OL,3,AUS urges Venezuela to release remaining
OL,4,Apolitical prisoners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has urged Venezuela to release
OL,7,Fthe remaining political prisoners being
OL,8,Fheld in the South American country.
OL,10,FMore than 1,000 political prisoners
OL,11,Fhave been freed since US forces seized
OL,12,FVenezuelan leader Nicolas Maduro in a
OL,13,Fmilitary raid on Caracas on 3 January
OL,14,Fand took him to New York, where he
OL,15,Ffaces trial on drug-trafficking and
OL,16,Ftorture charges.
OL,18,FBut Venezuelan prisoners' rights group
OL,19,FForo Penal says 322 people remain in
OL,20,Fdetention.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
