OL,3,AUS urges Venezuela to release remaining
OL,4,Apolitical prisoners
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio met
OL,7,Fhis Venezuelan counterpart, Oliver
OL,8,FBlanco, on Monday where he called for
OL,9,Ftheir release and discussed reforms
OL,10,Faimed at laying the groundwork for
OL,11,Ffree, fair, and credible elections, the
OL,12,FUS state department said.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
